{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他已经离开了曾经一起相处的人，不再逼自己选边，也开始接受当初离开的决定。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心软、想念、怕孤单、逐渐坚定\",\n      \"missed\": \"曾经和那些人在一起也确实开心过；他害怕以后独自生活，但不愿仅仅因为需要陪伴就回头。这两层原因藏在长句里，需要逐句读。小字里的波兰舞曲、沉重脚步、一个人站出来或一群人抬头的画面，以及右侧其他阶段提示也不容易一眼抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他已经决定不因为怀念过去而回头，接受自己当初离开的选择，继续往前生活。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心软、怕孤独、想念、不再自责、坚定\",\n      \"missed\": \"他为什么不愿回头：不是不怀念，而是不愿只为了有人陪伴就回去。曾经开心过和现在仍会心软这两层情绪，需要读完整句才能理解。右侧四条阶段提示也不容易进入第一眼视线。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他虽然还怀念过去、害怕孤独，但已经不再责怪自己离开，选择带着想念继续向前。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心软、想念、孤独感、释然、继续前行\",\n      \"missed\": \"不愿因为缺少陪伴就回头的具体原因，仍需要逐句读。新增的小字讲到脚步向前、音乐变色、地面短暂倾斜后继续前行，这一画面与人物状态有呼应，但字号较小、位置靠下，第一眼不容易抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"两个同样醒目的大段文字都承载了多层意思，第一段讲过去的冲突和离开，第二段讲怀念、害怕孤独、不再自责和不回头。虽然绿色重点能帮助抓住态度，但人物处境与核心感受分散在多个长句中，第一眼容易只记住几个立场，不一定马上理解他为什么既怀念又决定不回头。下半部分的音符动画与人物故事主要依靠较小的辅助文字建立联系，图像本身仍偏抽象。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e91990df-9449-4498-9eff-691b63525b0b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T002054451305Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.687, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:22:09.136578+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1429007b63fdf89b6a9690eba30cc88d2f9f1102dfdfa04bafa2f2a9e3d724dc", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T002054451305Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "bdf8dd02432271eb634ae19c6fd5cb63994de4367c7a4e3232fd96c3685880a8"}}}
